    "Everything you posted from here is deleted, your followers and the people you follow are let go, and every server that knew this account is told it is gone. It cannot be undone, and there is no way to get any of it back afterwards — take an archive from the Export button above first if you might want one." : "Tha a h-uile dad a chuir thu a-steach às an seo air a dhubhadh às, tha do luchd-leanmhainn agus na daoine a leanas tu air an leigeil às, agus thathar ag innse do gach frithealaiche a bha eòlach air a’ chunntas seo gu bheil e air falbh. Chan urrainnear a chuir dheth, agus chan eil dòigh ann air gin dheth fhaighinn air ais às deidh sin - gabh tasglann bhon phutan Export gu h-àrd an-toiseach ma tha thu ag iarraidh fear.",
    "Your Nextcloud account is not touched: you stay signed in to everything else, and you can make a new Social account straight away. The handle you are deleting is held for an hour so that nobody else can take it the moment you let it go, so a new account needs a different one." : "Chan eilear a’ suathadh ris a’ chunntas Nextcloud agad: fuirichidh tu air do chlàradh a-steach don a h-uile càil eile, agus faodaidh tu cunntas Sòisealta ùr a dhèanamh sa bhad. Tha an làmh a tha thu a’ sguabadh às air a chumail airson uair a thìde gus nach urrainn do dhuine sam bith eile a ghabhail cho luath ‘s a leigeas tu air falbh e, agus mar sin feumaidh cunntas ùr fear eile.",
    "A post that already reached somebody else's server is deleted by asking that server to delete it. Almost all of them do; none of them can be made to." : "Thèid post a ràinig air frithealaiche cuideigin eile mar-thà a sguabadh às le bhith ag iarraidh air an fhrithealaiche sin a sguabadh às. Tha cha mhòr a h-uile gin dhiubh a 'dèanamh; chan urrainn gin dhiubh a dhèanamh.",
