    "Nobody in these directories matched. A full handle — like @someone@example.org — finds a person on any server, listed or not." : "Cha do choinnich duine anns na clàran seo. Bidh làmh slàn - mar @ someone@example.org - a’ lorg neach air frithealaiche sam bith, air a liostadh no nach eil.",
