    "Leave as it is (until {date})" : "Fàg mar a tha e (gu {date})",
    "Give the filter a name, so you know what it was for later." : "Thoir ainm don chriathrag, gus am bi fios agad carson a bha e nas fhaide air adhart.",
    "One of the words is empty. Fill it in or take the row out — a filter with an empty word would match every post there is." : "Tha aon de na facail falamh. Lìon a-steach e no thoir a-mach an t-sreath - bhiodh criathrag le facal falamh a’ freagairt ris a h-uile post a th’ ann.",
    "Tick at least one place for the filter to apply, or it does nothing anywhere." : "Cuir diog co-dhiù aon àite airson an sìoltachan a chuir an sàs, no cha dèan e dad an àite sam bith.",
    "New filter" : "Criathrag ùr",
    "Editing “{title}”" : "Deasachadh “{title}”",
    "This filter has expired and is not doing anything. Saving it starts it again for as long as the expiry below says." : "Tha an criathar seo air tighinn gu crìch agus chan eil e a’ dèanamh dad. Le bhith ga shàbhaladh tòisichidh e a-rithist cho fada ‘s a tha an ùine gu h-ìosal ag ràdh.",
    "Name of the filter" : "Ainm a' chriathrag",
    "What you are filtering, in your own words" : "Na tha thu a’ sìoladh, nad fhaclan fhèin",
    "Words to look for" : "Abairtean ri lorg",
    "A post is filtered if any one of these appears in it: in the text, in the content warning, in the description of a picture or in the options of a poll. A boost is read as the post it boosts. Upper and lower case never matter." : "Tha post air a shìoladh ma nochdas gin dhiubh sin ann: san teacsa, san rabhadh susbaint, anns an tuairisgeul air dealbh no anns na roghainnean bhòtaidh. Thathas a’ leughadh àrdachadh mar am post a bhios e ag àrdachadh. Chan eil cùis àrd agus ìosal gu diofar.",
    "Word or phrase" : "Facal no abairt",
    "Whole word only" : "Facal slàn a-mhàin",
    "Remove this word" : "Thoir air falbh am facal seo",
    "“Whole word only” is the difference between filtering “cat” and also filtering every “catalogue”. It is decided for each word on its own." : "Is e “facal slàn a-mhàin” an diofar eadar sìoladh “cat” agus cuideachd sìoladh a h-uile “catalog”. Tha e air a cho-dhùnadh airson gach facal leis fhèin.",
    "Add another word" : "Cuir facal eile ris",
    "Where it applies" : "Far a bheil e a 'buntainn",
    "A filter only works in the places you tick. Somewhere you did not tick, a matching post arrives as usual." : "Chan obraich criathar ach anns na h-àiteachan air an cuir thu diog. An àiteigin nach do chuir thu diog, thig post maidsidh mar as àbhaist.",
    "What happens to a post it matches" : "Dè thachras do phost a tha e coltach",
    "Fold it away, with a way to read it anyway" : "Paisg air falbh e, le dòigh air a leughadh co-dhiù",
    "The post keeps its place in the timeline, folded behind the name of this filter, and nothing of it is on the page until you press “Show anyway”. Nothing is kept from you — you are asked whether you want it." : "Bidh am post a’ cumail a h-àite san loidhne-tìm, air a phasgadh air cùl ainm a’ chriathrag seo, agus chan eil dad dheth air an duilleag gus am brùth thu “Seall co-dhiù”. Chan eil dad air a chumail bhuat - thèid faighneachd dhut a bheil thu ga iarraidh.",
    "Take it out of the timeline" : "Thoir a-mach às an loidhne-tìm e",
    "The post is not sent to you at all, here or in any app, and a conversation containing one simply has a gap. Nothing is deleted and nobody is told: lift the filter and the post is back." : "Chan eil am post air a chuir thugad idir, an seo no ann an app sam bith, agus tha beàrn ann an còmhradh anns a bheil fear. Chan eil dad air a dhubhadh às agus chan eilear ag innse do dhuine: tog an sìoltachan agus tha am post air ais.",
