    "Your Nextcloud made you an account. This is your address — anyone on Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube or any other server that speaks ActivityPub can follow it:" : "Rinn do Nextcloud cunntas dhut. Seo an seòladh agad - faodaidh duine sam bith air Mastodon, Pixelfed, PeerTube no frithealaiche sam bith eile a bhruidhneas ActivityPub a leantainn:",
