    "Following …" : "A' leantainn …",
    "Upload your follows" : "Luchdaich suas do leanas",
    "On Mastodon: Preferences → Import and export → Data export → Follows (CSV). Moving your followers over as well is in Settings, under Migration — that one is a one-way move, so it is not a button here." : "Air Mastodon: Roghainnean → Import agus às-mhalairt → Às-mhalairt dàta → A’ leantainn (CSV). Tha gluasad do luchd-leanmhainn a-null cuideachd ann an Settings, fo Imrich - is e gluasad aon-shligheach a th’ ann am fear sin, mar sin chan e putan a th’ ann an seo.",
    "That is all there is to it" : "Is e sin a tha ann dha",
