    "You have not followed anyone yet, and that is fine: Discover is always a click away in the sidebar. Say hello in the meantime — a first post is how the fediverse finds out you are here." : "Cha do lean thu duine sam bith fhathast, agus tha sin ceart gu leòr: tha Discover an-còmhnaidh cliog air falbh sa bhàr-thaobh. Abair hello san eadar-ama - is e a’ chiad phost mar a gheibh an mediverse a-mach gu bheil thu an seo.",
