    "This decides what happens from now on. It does not take back a quote somebody has already posted — use the list below for that." : "Bidh seo a’ co-dhùnadh dè thachras bho seo a-mach. Cha bhith e a’ toirt air ais cuòt a chuir cuideigin a-steach mu thràth - cleachd an liosta gu h-ìosal airson sin.",
