    "Detaching tells the other server, which then shows the quote as withdrawn. The post itself is theirs and stays where it is." : "Bidh dealachadh ag innse don fhrithealaiche eile, a tha an uairsin a’ sealltainn a’ chuòt mar a chaidh a tharraing air ais. Is ann leotha fhèin a tha am post agus fuirichidh e far a bheil e.",
