    "Nothing is waiting to be posted. The clock in the composer schedules a post for later." : "Chan eil dad a’ feitheamh ri bhith air a phostadh. Bidh an uaireadair anns an tè a rinn an t-òran a' clàradh post airson nas fhaide air adhart.",
    "Search results for “{term}”" : "Toraidhean rannsachaidh airson “{term}”",
    "Searching …" : "A’ lorg …",
    "No results found" : "Cha deach toradh a lorg",
    "Nothing on this server matches “{term}”. Searching for a full handle like @user@example.org can find somebody this server has not met yet." : "Chan eil dad air an t-seirbheisiche seo a’ maidseadh “{term}”. Le bhith a’ lorg làmh slàn mar @user@example.org lorgar cuideigin nach do choinnich am frithealaiche seo fhathast.",
    "People" : "Daoine",
    "Hashtags" : "Hashtags",
    "Posts" : "Puist",
    "Play sounds" : "Cluich fuaimean",
    "Listen" : "Eisdibh",
    "A soft tick when you like something, a breath of air when a post goes out, and a two-note chime when a direct message arrives. Off until you turn it on." : "Cuir diog bog nuair as toil leat rudeigin, anail èadhair nuair a thèid post a-mach, agus clisgeadh dà-nota nuair a thig teachdaireachd dhìreach. Cuir dheth gus an tionndaidh thu air.",
    "Vibrate" : "Crith",
    "A short tap in the hand on a phone when you like, boost, react or post. Your system setting for less motion turns it off as well." : "Tap goirid nad làimh air fòn nuair a thogras tu, àrdachadh, freagairt no post. Bidh suidheachadh an t-siostaim agad airson nas lugha de ghluasad ga thionndadh dheth cuideachd.",
    ".well-known/webfinger isn't properly set up!" : "Chan eil .well-known/webfinger air a stèidheachadh ceart!",
    "Social needs the .well-known automatic discovery to be properly set up. If Nextcloud is not installed in the root of the domain, it is often the case that Nextcloud cannot configure this automatically. To use Social, the administrator of this Nextcloud instance needs to manually configure the .well-known redirects:" : "Sòisealta Feumaidh an .well-aithne fèin-ghluasadach lorg a stèidheachadh ceart. Mura h-eil Nextcloud air a chuir a-steach ann am freumh an àrainn, gu tric chan urrainn dha Nextcloud seo a rèiteachadh gu fèin-ghluasadach. Gus Sòisealta a chleachdadh, feumaidh rianadair an eisimpleir Nextcloud seo na h-ath-sheòlaidhean .well-aithnichte a rèiteachadh le làimh:",
    "Open documentation" : "Sgrìobhainnean fosgailte",
    "Mastodon apps cannot connect to this server" : "Chan urrainn dha aplacaidean Mastodon ceangal ris an fhrithealaiche seo",
    "The web server has to map /api, /oauth and two /.well-known paths onto Social. It has to do that as an internal proxy and not as a redirect: Nextcloud routes on the address a request arrived at, so a plain rewrite answers 404, and many clients drop their authorization when they follow a redirect. Inside the Apache virtual host that serves Nextcloud:" : "Feumaidh an t-seirbheisiche lìn mapadh /api, /oauth agus dà shlighe /. ainmeil gu Social. Feumaidh e sin a dhèanamh mar neach-ionaid a-staigh agus chan ann mar ath-sheòladh: slighean Nextcloud air an t-seòladh a thàinig iarrtas, agus mar sin bidh ath-sgrìobhadh sìmplidh a’ freagairt 404, agus bidh mòran de luchd-dèiligidh a’ leigeil seachad an cead nuair a leanas iad ath-sheòladh. Taobh a-staigh aoigheachd brìgheil Apache a tha a’ frithealadh Nextcloud:",
    "Whatever the rules proxy to has to serve this Nextcloud itself. A host or port that serves a different document root — one with no virtual host for this domain, say — answers 404 for every proxied request, which looks exactly like having no rules at all. An Apache 404 page names the port it came from, which tells the two apart." : "Ge bith dè na riaghailtean a dh’ fheumas neach-ionaid a bhith a ’frithealadh an Nextcloud seo fhèin. Bidh aoigheachd no port a tha a’ frithealadh freumh sgrìobhainn eadar-dhealaichte - fear gun aoigh brìgheil airson an raon seo, can - a’ freagairt 404 airson a h-uile iarrtas neach-ionaid, a tha a’ coimhead dìreach mar nach eil riaghailtean idir ann. Tha duilleag Apache 404 ag ainmeachadh a’ phort às an tàinig e, a tha ag innse na dhà bho chèile.",
    "The rules for nginx, what each one is for, and what else changes once requests arrive through a proxy are in the documentation. Nothing else is affected: the web interface and federation with other servers work without any of this." : "Tha na riaghailtean airson nginx, carson a tha gach fear, agus dè eile a dh’ atharraicheas aon uair ‘s gun ruig iarrtasan tro neach-ionaid anns na sgrìobhainnean. Chan eil buaidh sam bith eile air: bidh an eadar-aghaidh lìn agus caidreachas le frithealaichean eile ag obair às aonais seo.",
    "Social is set up for a different address than this server" : "Tha sòisealta air a chuir air dòigh airson seòladh eile seach an fhrithealaiche seo",
    "Changing it renames every account and post that already exists here, so Social will not do it on its own. Either point the server back at the address Social knows, or reset Social with \"occ social:reset\" — which deletes everything it holds." : "Le bhith ga atharrachadh bidh e ag ath-ainmeachadh a h-uile cunntas agus post a tha ann mar-thà an seo, agus mar sin cha dèan Sòisealta e leis fhèin. An dàrna cuid comharraich am frithealaiche air ais chun t-seòladh a tha fios aig Sòisealta, no ath-shuidhich Sòisealta le “occ social: reset” - a sguabas às a h-uile dad a th’ aige.",
    "Everyone" : "A h-uile duine",
