    "All starter packs" : "A h-uile pasgan tòiseachaidh",
    "Follow everyone" : "Lean a h-uile duine",
    "Their server did not answer. That is often a passing rate limit — and permanent if this Nextcloud cannot be reached from the internet, because a server that only answers signed requests has to fetch this one’s key to check the signature." : "Cha do fhreagair am frithealaiche aca. Tha sin gu tric na chrìoch ìre dol seachad - agus maireannach mura h-urrainnear an Nextcloud seo a ruighinn bhon eadar-lìn, oir feumaidh frithealaiche nach freagair ach iarrtasan soidhnichte an iuchair seo fhaighinn gus an ainm-sgrìobhte a sgrùdadh.",
    "No starter packs" : "Gun phasgan tòiseachaidh",
    "An administrator can add some with the starter_packs app setting." : "Faodaidh rianadair cuid a chur ris le suidheachadh app starter_packs.",
    "Search the fediverse" : "Lorg an mediverse",
    "Any name or handle, on any server — including servers this one has never met. A full handle like @someone@example.org finds a person anywhere." : "Ainm no làmh sam bith, air frithealaiche sam bith - a’ toirt a-steach frithealaichean nach do choinnich am fear seo a-riamh. Bidh làmh slàn mar @someone@example.org a’ lorg neach an àite sam bith.",
    "Because of who you follow" : "Air sgàth cò tha thu a ' leantainn",
    "The people you follow follow other people. This asks their servers who, and puts the ones several of them share first." : "Bidh na daoine a leanas tu a’ leantainn dhaoine eile. Bidh seo a’ faighneachd dha na frithealaichean aca cò, agus a’ cur an fheadhainn a bhios grunn dhiubh a’ roinn an toiseach.",
    "People this server knows" : "Daoine air a bheil am frithealaiche seo eòlach",
