    "Featured hashtags" : "Hashtags sònraichte",
    "The hashtags you want your profile to be known for. They sit under your bio, and anybody can click one to read what you posted with it." : "Na hashtags air a bheil thu airson gum bi do phròifil aithnichte. Bidh iad nan suidhe fon bio agad, agus faodaidh duine cliogadh air fear gus na chuir thu a-steach leis a leughadh.",
    "The hashtags Social has noticed you reading, the biggest first. They make up your My interests feed: drag one to change its place, pin it, remove it, or add your own. Nobody but you sees this." : "Tha na hashtags Social air mothachadh gu bheil thu a’ leughadh, a’ chiad fhear as motha. Bidh iad a’ dèanamh suas do bhiadhadh Na h-ùidhean agam: slaod fear airson àite atharrachadh, prìne e, thoir air falbh e, no cuir do chuid fhèin ris. Chan eil duine ach thusa a’ faicinn seo.",
    "A list is a few of the people you follow, read as a timeline of its own. Your lists are in the sidebar." : "Is e liosta cuid de na daoine a leanas tu, leugh mar loidhne-tìm fhèin. Tha na liostaichean agad sa bhàr-taobh.",
    "Scheduled posts" : "Postan clàraichte",
    "What you have written to be published later. Move one to another time or cancel it here." : "Na tha thu air a sgrìobhadh ri fhoillseachadh nas fhaide air adhart. Gluais fear gu àm eile no cuir dheth e an seo.",
    "Portfolio" : "Pasgan",
    "A page of your work with its own address, to put on a CV. A profile is a feed — everything you posted, newest first, with the follow button and the boosts around it. This is the opposite: a title, a sentence, the pictures you chose, and nothing else. Anybody can read it without signing in, so only your public photos are ever on it." : "Duilleag den obair agad le seòladh fhèin, airson a chuir air CV. Is e biadhadh a th’ ann am pròifil - a h-uile dad a chuir thu a-steach, as ùire an-toiseach, leis a’ phutan a leanas agus na h-àrdachaidhean timcheall air. Seo a chaochladh: tiotal, seantans, na dealbhan a thagh thu, agus gun dad eile. Faodaidh duine sam bith a leughadh gun a bhith a’ clàradh a-steach, agus mar sin chan eil ach na dealbhan poblach agad a-riamh air.",
    "Archived posts" : "Postan air an tasglann",
    "Posts you have put away. They are off your profile and out of every timeline here, and nobody was told — an archived post is still on the servers that received it, which is what deleting is for. Put one back whenever you like." : "Na puist a chuir thu air falbh. Tha iad far do phròifil agus a-mach às a h-uile loidhne-tìm an seo, agus cha deach innse do dhuine - tha post tasglainn fhathast air na frithealaichean a fhuair e, agus is ann air sgàth sin a tha cuir às. Cuir fear air ais uair sam bith a thogras tu.",
    "Waiting to be looked at" : "A’ feitheamh ri coimhead",
    "Some posts are kept for a moderator to see before they go out — the first post of a new account, and posts that tripped one of this server's spam rules. Yours are here until somebody looks at them. You can take one back; nobody is told if you do." : "Bithear a’ cumail cuid de phuist airson am faicear modaireatair mus tèid iad a-mach – a’ chiad phost de chunntas ùr, agus puist a thug air falbh aon de riaghailtean spama an fhrithealaiche seo. Tha do chuid an seo gus am faic cuideigin iad. Faodaidh tu tè a thoirt air ais; chan eil duine air innse dhut ma nì thu.",
    "Looking back" : "A' coimhead air ais",
    "Posts you wrote on this day in earlier years appear at the top of your feed on their own. This is the other half: a note about the week just gone, if you want one." : "Bidh puist a sgrìobh thu air an latha seo sna bliadhnaichean roimhe sin a’ nochdadh aig mullach do bhiadhaidh leotha fhèin. Seo an leth eile: nota mun t-seachdain dìreach air falbh, ma tha thu ag iarraidh fear.",
    "Sound and touch" : "Fuaim agus suathadh",
    "Small confirmations you hear or feel. They are kept on this device only, so a laptop at work can stay quiet while your phone taps back." : "Dearbhaidhean beaga a chluinneas tu no a tha thu a’ faireachdainn. Tha iad air an cumail air an inneal seo a-mhàin, agus mar sin faodaidh laptop aig an obair fuireach sàmhach fhad ‘s a bhios am fòn agad a’ tapadh air ais.",
    "Authorized apps" : "Aplacaidean ùghdarraichte",
    "The apps you have signed in to with this account — a phone client, a cross-poster, anything that asked. Each one holds a key to your account until you take it back, so this is the page to open after losing a phone." : "Na h-aplacaidean air an do chuir thu a-steach leis a’ chunntas seo - neach-dèiligidh fòn, crois-phostair, rud sam bith a dh’ iarr thu. Bidh iuchair don chunntas agad aig gach fear gus an toir thu air ais e, agus mar sin is e seo an duilleag a dh’ fhosglas às deidh dhut fòn a chall.",
    "Introduction" : "Ro-ràdh",
    "The four steps shown when your account was new: your address, people to follow, and the follows you had on another server." : "Na ceithir ceumannan a chaidh a shealltainn nuair a bha do chunntas ùr: do sheòladh, daoine ri leantainn, agus na leanas a bh’ agad air frithealaiche eile.",
    "The keys this app listens for while you are reading." : "Na h-iuchraichean a bhios an aplacaid seo ag èisteachd fhad ‘s a tha thu a’ leughadh.",
    "Delete your Social account" : "Sguab às do chunntas sòisealta",
    "Your fediverse account, gone, while your Nextcloud account stays exactly as it is. Last, and on its own, because it is the one thing on this page that cannot be undone." : "Tha an cunntas fìnealta agad, air falbh, fhad ‘s a tha an cunntas Nextcloud agad a’ fuireach dìreach mar a tha e. Mu dheireadh, agus leis fhèin, oir is e an aon rud air an duilleag seo nach urrainnear a chuir às.",
    "Everything this app keeps about you and the way you use it. Nothing here changes until you change it." : "A h-uile dad a bhios an aplacaid seo a’ cumail mu do dheidhinn agus mar a chleachdas tu e. Chan atharraich dad an seo gus an atharraich thu e.",
    "All time" : "A h-uile àm",
