    "{label}: {now} over the last {days} days, against {before} over the {days} before them." : "{label}: {now} thairis air na làithean {days} mu dheireadh, an aghaidh {before} thairis air an {days} a bha romhpa.",
    "Reach is an estimate: your followers today, plus the followers of everybody who boosted the post. Audiences that overlap are counted twice, and nobody can count the people who saw a post without touching it." : "Is e tuairmse a th’ ann an Reach: do luchd-leanmhainn an-diugh, a bharrachd air luchd-leantainn a h-uile duine a bhrosnaich am post. Bidh luchd-èisteachd a tha a’ dol thairis air an cunntadh dà uair, agus chan urrainn dha duine na daoine a chunnaic post a chunntadh gun a bhith a’ beantainn ris.",
    "_The audience of one account that boosted you is not known here, and counts as nobody._::_The audiences of {count} accounts that boosted you are not known here, and count as nobody._" : ["Chan eil fios an seo air luchd-èisteachd aon chunntas a bhrosnaich thu, agus chan eil e a’ cunntadh mar dhuine sam bith.", "Chan eil fios aig luchd-èisteachd nan cunntasan {count} a bhrosnaich thu an seo, agus chan eil iad a’ cunntadh mar dhuine sam bith.", "Chan eil fios aig luchd-èisteachd nan cunntasan {count} a bhrosnaich thu an seo, agus chan eil iad a’ cunntadh mar dhuine sam bith.", "Chan eil fios aig luchd-èisteachd nan cunntasan {count} a bhrosnaich thu an seo, agus chan eil iad a’ cunntadh mar dhuine sam bith."],
