    "A floor rather than a total: a like on a server that never told this one about it cannot be counted anywhere. There are no impressions to divide by either, so the rate is against your follower count." : "Làr seach iomlan: chan urrainnear a leithid air frithealaiche nach do dh’ innis don fhear seo mu dheidhinn a chunntadh an àite sam bith. Chan eil beachdan sam bith ann airson a roinn leis an dàrna cuid, agus mar sin tha an ìre an aghaidh a’ chunntais neach-leantainn agad.",
