    "A step in this line is usually the survey reaching servers it had not reached before, rather than the network changing size — so no year-on-year figure is shown for a year that has one in it." : "Is e ceum san loidhne seo mar as trice an suirbhidh a’ ruighinn luchd-frithealaidh nach robh e air a ruighinn roimhe, seach an lìonra ag atharrachadh meud - mar sin chan eil figear bliadhna an dèidh bliadhna air a shealltainn airson bliadhna aig a bheil fear ann.",
