    "_picture posted_::_pictures posted_" : ["dealbh air a phostadh", "dealbhan air an postadh", "dealbhan air an postadh", "dealbhan air an postadh"],
    "Settings → Your account → Download an archive of your data, and wait for the mail. Your posts and their pictures are in it. The accounts you followed are in it only as numbers, so there is nobody in that file to look up — and nothing on X federates, so no follower can come with you." : "Settings → An cunntas agad → Luchdaich sìos tasglann den dàta agad, agus feitheamh ris a 'phost. Tha na puist agad agus na dealbhan aca innte. Tha na cunntasan a lean thu ann dìreach mar àireamhan, agus mar sin chan eil duine san fhaidhle sin airson coimhead suas - agus chan eil dad air X federates, agus mar sin chan urrainn do neach-leantainn sam bith a thighinn còmhla riut.",
    "Settings → Accounts Centre → Your information and permissions → Download your information, and choose JSON. The HTML download holds the pages and not the posts. Your posts, your reels and the list of accounts you follow are all in that one file." : "Roghainnean → Ionad Cunntasan → Am fiosrachadh agus na ceadan agad → Luchdaich sìos am fiosrachadh agad, agus tagh JSON. Bidh an luchdachadh sìos HTML a’ cumail nan duilleagan agus chan e na puist. Tha na puist agad, na ruidhlichean agad agus an liosta de chunntasan a leanas tu uile san aon fhaidhle sin.",
    "Settings → Account → Download your data. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "website → Luchdaich a-nuas an dàta fiosrachaidh. Bidh an tasglann a’ cumail do bhideothan mar fhaidhlichean seach mar phuist, agus mar sin chan eil dad an seo as urrainn a leughadh mar loidhne-tìm fhathast.",
    "TikTok posts cannot be imported from the archive yet. A video at a time can still be brought over by its address from Settings → Moving in, and everything below this step works the same." : "Chan urrainnear puist TikTok a thoirt a-steach bhon tasglann fhathast. Faodar bhidio aig aon àm a thoirt a-null leis an t-seòladh aige bho Settings → A 'gluasad a-steach, agus tha a h-uile dad fon cheum seo ag obair mar an ceudna.",
    "Google Takeout → YouTube and YouTube Music. The archive holds your videos as files rather than as posts, so there is nothing here that can read it as a timeline yet." : "Google Takeout → YouTube agus YouTube Music. Bidh an tasglann a’ cumail do bhideothan mar fhaidhlichean seach mar phuist, agus mar sin chan eil dad an seo as urrainn a leughadh mar loidhne-tìm fhathast.",
    "Your own uploads are yours to re-publish rather than something to import in bulk — they are whole videos, and each one belongs on a post you write." : "Is ann leatsa a tha na luchdachadh suas agad fhèin airson ath-fhoillseachadh seach rudeigin ri thoirt a-steach gu ìre mhòr - is e bhideothan slàn a th’ annta, agus buinidh gach fear do phost a sgrìobhas tu.",
    "_Brought over %n post._::_Brought over %n posts._" : ["Air a thoirt thairis air %n post.", "Air a thoirt thairis air %n post.", "Air a thoirt thairis air %n post.", "Air a thoirt thairis air %n post."],
